      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mansfield%2C_Massachusetts"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Old Colony History Museum houses regional artifacts and a genealogy research library, preserving Mansfield’s local heritage.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.mansfieldlibraryma.com/additional-historical-resources/"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Mansfield was named for William Murray, 1st Earl of Mansfield, a pro‑colonial member of the House of Lords.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
