      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mansfield%2C_Massachusetts"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The Mansfield Historical Society, part of the Old Colony Historical Society founded in 1853, safeguards the town’s archives.",
